  "turn_trace": "dev 60 deg capped turn, yaw held, fast-brain-11-b-cw13 vs its label teacher in the same states: left, the teacher asks roll -0.25..-0.50 and the brain gives -0.07..-0.11, decaying to 0 (and later +0.1); right, teacher +0.26..+0.44, brain +0.06..+0.17. Pitch-back is about half the teacher's on both sides.",
