  "contacts": "dev hill 7210-7215: fast-brain-11-b-cw13 6 contacts 13.97 s, fast-brain-12-a 9 / 19.46 s; both track the descent request vertically within 0.004 m/s; brain-12-a keeps more horizontal speed (-0.36 vs -0.66 m/s under the request) but the pilot asks it for steeper descents (-1.92 vs -1.78 m/s); on the fresh gate sets brain-08 (which sinks 0.29 m/s less than asked) has the fewest contacts and FastMotorPD (exact) more than fast-brain-10b"
